 154:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_f32.c **** * algorithms that operated on floating-point data.  These functions are still
 155:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_f32.c **** * provided but are deprecated.  The older functions are slower and less general
 156:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_f32.c **** * than the new functions.
 157:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_f32.c **** * \par
